Flashing

-> A feedback mechanism in form of one time notifictaions to the user based on some action

-> flash messages

-> These flash messages are stored in the server in session storage Session -> Any data stored in session storage has to use a secret key to secure it -> The secret key signs the data stored in session securing it

Message Categories 
1. Sucess - successfull responses e.g. product added successfully - green
2. Danger / Error - error messages e.g insufficient stock - red
3. Warning - warning - e.g. stock depleting - yellow
4. Info - general info e.g offers - blue


Flash messages have 2 parts
a) Message - the actual feedback
b) Category - broader class of messages grouped by type -> We use flash() imported from flask to display messages from flash messages


